	(text
		""
		(at 19.28 109.71 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f4697d90-9ca2-5c94-af04-c527f5b8dd93")
	)
	(text
		"J1 pin 1 = +12 V, pin 2 = GND (JST S2B-XH-A, mate with XHP-2)."
		(at 19.28 113.71 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "90a7158b-d331-5fab-a40f-8652021a7b59")
	)
	(text
		"Supply range 12 V +/-5 %, 10.8 to 12.6 V, qualified maximum 12.6 V. Chain: J1 > F1 > (D1 TVS to GND) > Q1 > +12V_PROT."
		(at 19.28 116.25 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b2feb8c9-d2e1-5196-82ea-53587b9a057e")
	)
	(text
		"D1 SMAJ13A (Littelfuse): standoff 13.0 V, 0.4 V above the 12.6 V maximum input; leakage 1 uA max at 13.0 V, lower at 12.6 V; clamp 21.5 V max at 18.6 A."
		(at 19.28 118.79 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2661c1ad-14c5-5909-8064-3d6341064317")
	)
	(text
		"D1 clamps on VIN_12V_FUSED before Q1: 21.5 V is below Q1 AO3401A 30 V drain-source, MP2307 23 V recommended input and 26 V absolute maximum."
		(at 19.28 121.33 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3adb9860-876f-5eaf-b419-a01010c174d5")
	)
	(text
		"A reversed supply forward-biases D1 and F1 opens."
		(at 19.28 123.87 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b5664002-9201-5b59-a4bc-1be69d25039d")
	)
	(text
		"Q1 source = load side, drain = input side. D9 5.1 V zener limits |Vgs| through R1 47k; Q1 AO3401A (Alpha & Omega): 30 V drain-source, 12 V gate-source maximum, so the 5.1 V zener leaves 6.9 V of margin."
		(at 19.28 126.41 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "24822e0f-850c-5bab-b040-a89f7ee69383")
	)
	(text
		""
		(at 626.13 338.98 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "81feff1b-2c1b-581a-9c00-2e56a93a867a")
	)
	(text
		"FB divider: 0.925 V x (1 + 44.2k/10k) = 5.01 V (0.925 V reference from the MP2307 datasheet)."
		(at 626.13 342.98 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3d732e2c-e2dd-5f23-ad30-b7dc0d810bc5")
	)
	(text
		"Input current at the 3 A regulator limit and 10.8 V in: 15 W / (0.9 x 10.8 V) = 1.55 A. PWR12 and SWNODE 0.6 mm carry about 1.65 A (IPC-2221, 1 oz external, 10 C rise)."
		(at 626.13 345.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "352bc1d8-8f01-59ef-8069-f5c6686eabbe")
	)
	(text
		"BUCK_SW is a short run of under 10 mm beside U1 and L1; PWR5 0.6 mm carries the 5 V trunk (1.5 A needs 0.53 mm, IPC-2221, 1 oz external, 10 C rise)."
		(at 626.13 348.06 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d2edaebf-0ed4-5bc7-b591-c178e8ad224d")
	)
	(text
		"EN divider 100k/33k: buck starts above about 4.8 V in."
		(at 626.13 350.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c3b9684e-5f41-55d2-89f8-083af271b272")
	)
	(text
		""
		(at 17.56 453.28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b6c1125d-24ae-537c-93ed-2724b8e7c144")
	)
	(text
		"LOAD_EN default is OFF (R7 pull-down). High (above 1.0 V) turns +5V_SW on."
		(at 17.56 457.28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "68cb2bd6-a3d3-5611-a508-883932ed6702")
	)
	(text
		"AMS1117 thermal: the supported load is 0.35 A. (5 - 3.3) V x 0.35 A = 0.60 W; at 90 C/W (AMS datasheet, SOT-223) the junction rises 54 C, so 0.35 A holds to 71 C ambient (125 C limit); the load limit is (125 C - ambient) / (90 C/W x 1.7 V): 0.36 A at 70 C."
		(at 17.56 459.82 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d451c579-21fd-5804-8850-3c2e25aeb222")
	)
	(text
		""
		(at 336.12 391.05 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8b3ccfeb-0d77-5ec9-978a-5af8b1d9b132")
	)
	(text
		"J3 pin 1 = +5V, J4 pin 1 = +5V_SW, J5 pin 1 = +3V3; pin 2 of each = GND."
		(at 336.12 395.05 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "aa2c5c85-8167-5545-b506-45aad78af714")
	)
	(text
		""
		(at 270.39 224.615 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "70bf0d8b-7ba6-5269-89c2-37431dace1a5")
	)
	(text
		"J2: 1 +3V3_REF, 2 GND, 3 LOAD_EN, 4 GND, 5 SENSE_12V, 6 SENSE_5V, 7 SENSE_3V3, 8 GND."
		(at 270.39 228.615 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "38511cf4-3f73-50e0-8c64-3f4da5fee4f4")
	)
	(text
		"No FAULT pin: no part on the board produces a fault signal."
		(at 270.39 231.155 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6ec80880-799f-5d40-9bfb-4d6d9d4e7717")
	)
	(text
		""
		(at 434.57 485.03 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b66f61ab-dfc0-55e8-bb89-ff25ca3fceb0")
	)
	(text
		"D2 white raw input (via D8 reverse block), D3 blue +12V_PROT, D4 green +5V, D5 green +5V_SW, D6 amber +3V3, D7 red fuse fault."
		(at 434.57 489.03 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b0b02def-8799-5179-813f-69bae91fb538")
	)
	(text
		"D7 lights when the voltage across F1 exceeds about 2 V, i.e. F1 has tripped."
		(at 434.57 491.57 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0af11626-91d4-5536-9eb8-477761cb811f")
	)
